{'symbol': 'ABBV', 'date': '2023-05-15 08:45:00', 'title': 'SKINVIVE™ BY JUVÉDERM® RECEIVES U.S. FDA APPROVAL', 'text': 'THE FIRST AND ONLY HYALURONIC ACID INTRADERMAL MICRODROPLET INJECTION, APPROVED FOR IMPROVED SKIN SMOOTHNESS OF THE CHEEKS IRVINE, CALIF. , MAY 15, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, ALLERGAN AESTHETICS, AN ABBVIE COMPANY (NYSE:\xa0ABBV), ANNOUNCED THE U.S. FDA APPROVAL OF SKINVIVE™ BY JUVÉDERM®\xa0TO IMPROVE SKIN SMOOTHNESS OF THE CHEEKS IN ADULTS OVER THE AGE OF 21.1 SKINVIVE™ BY JUVÉDERM® IS THE FIRST AND ONLY HYALURONIC ACID (HA) INTRADERMAL MICRODROPLET INJECTION FOR SKIN SMOOTHNESS AVAILABLE IN THE U.S. WITH RESULTS LASTING THROUGH SIX MONTHS WITH OPTIMAL TREATMENT.1 SKINVIVE™ BY JUVÉDERM® IS A SMOOTH, INJECTABLE HA GEL THAT CONTAINS A SMALL AMOUNT OF LOCAL ANESTHETIC (LIDOCAINE).1 UNLIKE OTHER FACIAL INJECTABLES THAT ENHANCE AND AUGMENT THE TREATMENT AREA, SKINVIVE™ BY JUVÉDERM® IMPROVES SKIN QUALITY IN THE CHEEKS BY SMOOTHING THE SKIN AND INCREASING HYDRATION.'}